== Shrine and Adjacent Features == * Adjacent to the kofun lies {{ill|Konda Hachimangū|ja|誉田八幡宮|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Konda Hachimangū|qq=}}, Japan's oldest {{ill|Hachiman Shrine|ja|八幡宮|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hachiman Shrine|qq=}}. * The {{ill|Imperial Household Agency|ja|宮内庁|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Imperial Household Agency|qq=}} maintains an office on-site for administration and preservation.
